WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.646
This example creates a view with quality flags It
marks missing

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:11.190
names invalid email shapes and invalid phone shapes
The final

00:00:11.216 --> 00:00:16.880
SELECT returns only rows that need attention Because
the source customer

00:00:16.906 --> 00:00:22.538
table is unchanged the view becomes a transparent
review layer This

00:00:22.551 --> 00:00:25.143
is a strong pattern for reproducible cleaning
